[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0010","text":"哼哼——……♪\n──……啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0020","text":"制作人去大学接夏叶小姐，\n我来负责果穗小姐她们的陪同～好的，明白了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0030","text":"不好意思\n让你们两个人费心了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0040","text":"说什么呢\n这种事不是理所当然的吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0050","text":"就是啊～，夏叶小姐同时也是学生嘛\n考试要加油哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0060","text":"……嗯！谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0065","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0070","text":"……还有，在外面那位\n可以进来了哦～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0080","text":"诶……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0090","text":"不好意思，一直没找到进来的时机……！\n谢谢您……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0100","text":"完全没注意到……／完全没注意到呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_03_0102","text":"Motion"}]
